pact the future of  Supreme Court case decisions about  affirmative action  well that 2016 case that I mentioned  Kennedy was the deciding vote and that  was a squeaker of a case it's only a  matter of time if where this issue gets  to the Supreme Court again in fact this  announcement may spark the lawsuit that  brings it up there again and if the  president nominates as he is expected to  do someone who is a reliable  conservative who is skeptical of  affirmative action it is very likely  that this will cut the other way next  time the issue goes to the hike  so I think you're gonna see affirmative  action right up there with abortion and  immigration during these confirmation  hearings just few cheering's up at the  quiet all right Paula Reid thanks Paula
 

